    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Moment of Fate】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description:</><Assistant_System>Moment of Fate</> is a <Assistant_Red>12v12 multiplayer battlefield</>. Beyonders are divided into two factions, and each match lasts <Assistant_Red>4 minutes</>. When the match ends, the side with the higher score wins; if the points are equal, compare kills, then damage dealt; if all are the same, a random side wins.\n<Assistant_Title2>Point Acquisition:</>You can obtain points by picking up <Assistant_Property1>Buff Orbs</>, killing, assisting, and entering the <Assistant_Property1>Vortex of Strife</> to compete. Buff Orbs provide points and attribute bonuses; when the countdown for the Vortex of Strife ends, Beyonders remaining in the vortex will split the points equally.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gathering Anchor:</>Gathering Anchors will appear in the match and last for <Assistant_Red>15 seconds</>. After entering the anchor and reaching the required number of people, stay for <Assistant_Red>3 seconds</> to assemble your faction's Beyonders here; Beyonders participating in the assembly will receive a time-limited attribute bonus.\n<Assistant_Title2>Matchmaking Rules:</>The gameplay entry shows the opening time as <Assistant_Red>10:00-1:00</>. Moment of Fate allows a maximum of <Assistant_Red>3-player team matchmaking</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Method:</>{JumpToUI:[前往命运时刻]|1250095}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Moment of Fate】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description:</><Assistant_System>Moment of Fate</> is a <Assistant_Red>12v12 multiplayer battlefield</>. Beyonders are divided into two factions, and each match lasts <Assistant_Red>4 minutes</>. When the match ends, the side with the higher score wins; if the points are equal, compare kills, then damage dealt; if all are the same, a random side wins.\n<Assistant_Title2>Point Acquisition:</>You can obtain points by picking up <Assistant_Property1>Buff Orbs</>, killing, assisting, and entering the <Assistant_Property1>Vortex of Strife</> to compete. Buff Orbs provide points and attribute bonuses; when the countdown for the Vortex of Strife ends, Beyonders remaining in the vortex will split the points equally.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gathering Anchor:</>Gathering Anchors will appear in the match and last for <Assistant_Red>15 seconds</>. After entering the anchor and reaching the required number of people, stay for <Assistant_Red>3 seconds</> to assemble your faction's Beyonders here; Beyonders participating in the assembly will receive a time-limited attribute bonus.\n<Assistant_Title2>Matchmaking Rules:</>The gameplay entry shows the opening time as <Assistant_Red>10:00-1:00</>. Moment of Fate allows a maximum of <Assistant_Red>3-player team matchmaking</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Method:</>{JumpToUI:[Go to Moment of Fate]|1250095}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【剧情事件】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>剧情事件记录着罪恶廷根中发生的各类案件。完成剧情事件可推进罪恶廷根主线故事，逐步解锁新的支线剧情，并揭开隐藏在城市暗面中的秘密。\n<Assistant_Title2>开启规则：</>\n1.完成指定前置剧情事件。\n2.部分事件达到等级要求。\n<Assistant_Title2>助手建议：</>\n1.首次进入玩法优先通关剧情事件。\n2.剧情事件将解锁新的挑战事件、竞技事件以及更多剧情内容，推进玩法进度。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Story Event】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>Story Events record various cases that occur in Sinful Tingen. Completing Story Events advances the main storyline of Sinful Tingen, gradually unlocking new side quests and uncovering secrets hidden in the dark side of the city. \n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Rules: </>\n1. Complete the specified prerequisite Story Event. \n2. Some events have level requirements. \n<Assistant_Title2>Assistant's Advice: </>\n1. Prioritize completing Story Events when first entering the gameplay. \n2. Story Events will unlock new Challenge Events, Competition Events, and more story content, advancing your gameplay progress.",
