    ["替人占卜真的很好赚—— 大部分人只是想要个人帮他们壮胆。 \n\n---------------------------------------------\n\n今天给人占卜，明明显示的结果是这样的，但竟然错了。 怎么可能，占卜不会有错， 也许是看错了。\n\n---------------------------------------------\n\n（中间几页被血迹沾染了，读不太清）\n\n---------------------------------------------\n\n 我见过太多人把启示当成天命， 然后死亡。"] = "Divining for others is really profitable—most people just want someone to help them build up their courage. \n\n --------------------------------------------- \n\n Divined for someone today, the result clearly showed this, but it was wrong. How is it possible, divination cannot be wrong, perhaps I misread it. \n\n --------------------------------------------- \n\n (The middle pages are stained with blood, hard to read) \n\n --------------------------------------------- \n\n I have seen too many people take revelations as destiny, and then die.",
